{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game where players manipulate and command a commander from a customized perspective, controlling an entire team to combat alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During battles, players can switch to any soldier at any time to serve as the commander, or they can independently control a squad or command all soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/Team.gif?t=1746497479\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Killing enemies in battle earns reinforcement points, which can be used to summon turrets, fighter planes, or battleships for support. Powerful turrets and aerial forces can quickly alter the dynamics of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/Weapon.gif?t=1746497479\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can also call for reinforcements, having transport planes deliver squads to the battlefield. This allows one's forces to overwhelm the enemy with numerical superiority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players can form a legion comprising five squads. They can choose from a variety of soldier classes, with different combinations of soldiers yielding better results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/Team2.gif?t=1746497479\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each soldier can also select their own powerful skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is under continuous development, with plans to refine and supplement various maps, introduce new monsters and races, and add and optimize enemy skills (especially boss skills) in subsequent updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503530?t=1746497479","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503530?t=1746497479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/6110cdf7fd571fad43bdb34519d1046c3a05a39f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746497479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/6110cdf7fd571fad43bdb34519d1046c3a05a39f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746497479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3559450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game where players manipulate and command a commander from a customized perspective, controlling an entire team to combat alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During battles, players can switch to any soldier at any time to serve as the commander, or they can independently control a squad or command all soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/Team.gif?t=1746497479\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Killing enemies in battle earns reinforcement points, which can be used to summon turrets, fighter planes, or battleships for support. Powerful turrets and aerial forces can quickly alter the dynamics of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/Weapon.gif?t=1746497479\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can also call for reinforcements, having transport planes deliver squads to the battlefield. This allows one's forces to overwhelm the enemy with numerical superiority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players can form a legion comprising five squads. They can choose from a variety of soldier classes, with different combinations of soldiers yielding better results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/Team2.gif?t=1746497479\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each soldier can also select their own powerful skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is under continuous development, with plans to refine and supplement various maps, introduce new monsters and races, and add and optimize enemy skills (especially boss skills) in subsequent updates.</p>","developers":["F.T"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/c8dfea5a1be60e6a90d65e413fe28e71e289a75b/header.jpg?t=1746497479","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128001,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128001/movie480.mp4?t=1745893087","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128001/movie_max.mp4?t=1745893087"},"name":"All_Front_Assault","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128001/88fe83d0ac9c9a4bd1f9487744aaad3480ef544b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745893087","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128001/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745893087","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128001/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745893087"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257130667,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130667/movie480.mp4?t=1745893090","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130667/movie_max.mp4?t=